  "priorExpiration": "2009-03-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.12 “Banked allowance” means an allowance that is unused and held in a general or compliance account. The term does not include allowances held in an account opened by participating states.\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14 (from Env-A 4602.11); ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20 (from Env-A 4602.13)",
